  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "It was one o'clock when we left the empty house on Lauriston Gardens.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.92
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "There is nothing like first hand evidence. My mind is entirely made up.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 6.875,
      "seconds": 4.34
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had read a man's height off the length of his stride.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 12.542,
      "seconds": 3.42
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "And his age off the width of a puddle the fellow stepped across.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 17.292,
      "seconds": 4.7
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Surely, I said, you are not as certain as you pretend to be.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 23.5,
      "seconds": 4.2
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "We drove into the dingiest and dreariest of a long succession of by-ways.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 29.125,
      "seconds": 5.8
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Audley Court was not an attractive locality.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 36.833,
      "seconds": 3.19
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "We picked our way among dirty children and under lines of discoloured linen.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 41.542,
      "seconds": 4.63
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Constable John Rance was in bed, and came down looking irritable.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 47.583,
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "We thought that we should like to hear it all from your own lips.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 53.833,
      "seconds": 3.03
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Holmes took a half-sovereign from his pocket and played with it.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 58.083,
      "seconds": 3.97
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_rance",
      "text": "I shall be most happy to tell you anything I can.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 63.292,
      "seconds": 3.55
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "His beat ran from ten at night until six in the morning.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 68.375,
      "seconds": 4.13
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "At two o'clock he saw a light in the window of the empty house.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 73.917,
      "seconds": 3.83
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "There was a candle burning, and a dead man on the boards.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 79.583,
      "seconds": 3.72
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had walked the room, and knelt by the body, and tried the kitchen door.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 84.625,
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "What sort of a man was he?",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 90.667,
      "seconds": 1.7
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A drunken fellow had been leaning on the railings, singing at the top of his voice.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 94.375,
      "seconds": 4.91
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A long chap, with a red face, the lower part muffled round.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 101.0,
      "seconds": 4.91
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "They had propped him up between them and let him walk away.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 107.25,
      "seconds": 3.86
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Holmes said nothing at all for a moment.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 112.625,
      "seconds": 3.42
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He laid the half-sovereign down and we left our informant uncomfortable.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 118.083,
      "seconds": 4.7
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The blundering fool, said Holmes, as we drove back to our lodgings.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 124.5,
      "seconds": 5.05
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "The ring, man, the ring. That was what he came back for.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 131.083,
      "seconds": 3.08
    }
  ]
}